{
  "version": 1,
  "scope": "CLI 每一层自描述（ADR-0068，PROJECT_SPEC §1.1 第 4 条）：命令树成为唯一命令清单，argv 解析与分发分支都按 tree id，链尾 assertNever 穷尽；help 在三层拼写下由命令树生成且不启动 Runtime；用法错误改为一行（退 2）；新增 runtime commands 与 help 两个命令；并修复 ADR-0055 / FOUNDATION-086 记录中缺失的 task recover CLI 分支。分发链被整体改写，因此把 CLI 命令面 e2e 全量作为本格的定向验证。",
  "commands": [
    {
      "id": "typecheck-cli-tree",
      "argv": ["bun", "run", "typecheck"],
      "cwd": ".",
      "timeoutSeconds": 300,
      "covers": "命令树与分发的一致性由类型系统承担：加节点不加分支、分支写错 id、unit 子命令名写错都必须编译失败（ChainId 的 assertNever）"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli-self-description",
      "argv": ["bun", "test", "apps/runtime/test/cli-help.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-command-surface.test.ts"],
      "cwd": ".",
      "timeoutSeconds": 300,
      "covers": "树里每个节点的 help 与树自身逐项一致、help 不启动 Runtime、用法错误一行退 2；每个 Runtime 命令都能追到 CLI 节点且其名字出现在 CLI 代码里；docs/guides/cli 覆盖每条命令"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli-task-recover",
      "argv": ["bun", "test", "apps/runtime/test/cli-task-recover.test.ts"],
      "cwd": ".",
      "timeoutSeconds": 300,
      "covers": "task recover 从真实 CLI 到达 Runtime 的 reconcile（而不是退 2 的用法错误），并保留自己的用法错误与 help"
    },
    {
      "id": "cli-command-face-regression",
      "argv": ["bun", "test", "apps/runtime/test/cli-agent-config.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-agent-plugins.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-attention.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-capacity-slots.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-claude-adapter.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-codex-adapter.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-global-control.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-impact.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-knowledge.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-managed-project.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-prose-question.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-prose-question-attention.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-reclaim-batch.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-reclaim.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-schedule.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-session-attach.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-session-guidance.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-session-handoff.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-settings.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-snapshot-recheck.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-targeted-tests.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-task-control.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-task-create.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-task-depends.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-task-purge.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-task-retry.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-task-run-progress.test.ts", "apps/runtime/test/cli-transcript.test.ts"],
      "cwd": ".",
      "timeoutSeconds": 1800,
      "covers": "整条分发链（39 个分支、16 个 unit 内部解析、退出码 0/1/2/3 与等待码）改写后，既有 CLI 命令面行为不变"
    }
  ]
